{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:AxB_ArtXIII_1_15","page_type":"section"},"citation":"AxB Art. XIII § 1 § 15","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/AxB_ArtXIII_1_15","content_hash":"7e03ce78ca6b1b74343c7449b081b33e7f5da5ab9a7422e0aa34a7c931e44534","heading":"Section 15. Point of contact and notices","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xiii-1-15:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/AxB_ArtXIII_1_15","text":"The company shall at all times maintain with the City a local point of contact who shall be available at all times to act on behalf of company in the event of an emergency. Company shall provide the City with said local contact’s name, address, telephone number, fax number, and e-mail address. Emergency notice by either party to the other may be made by telephone to the City’s designee as listed below. All other notices between the parties shall be in writing and shall be made by personal delivery, depositing such notice in the U.S. mail, certified mail (return receipt requested), or via the email addresses provided below. Any notice served by U.S. mail or certified mail (return receipt requested) shall be deemed delivered upon actual receipt unless otherwise provided. Other than emergencies, notices to the parties shall be to the following:\nThe City: | Company:\nThe City of Topeka Brenda Younger, City Clerk 215 SE 7th Street, Room 166 Topeka, Kansas 66603 Phone: 785-368-3940 Fax: 785-368-3943 Email: cclerk@topeka.org | Kansas Gas Service, a Div. of ONE Gas, Inc. Attn: Legal Department 7421 W. 129th Street Overland Park, KS 66213-2713 Phone: (913) 319-8619 Fax: N/A Email: kgsfranchises@onegas.com\nEmergency Contact Information: Emergency Designee: Consolidated Emergency Communications Center (CECC) Emergency Contact No.: 911 Emergency Email: N/A Secondary Contact Email: bcopley@topeka.org | Natural Gas Emergency No: 888-492-4950 Contact Email: KGSDispatchOverlandPark@onegas.com\n(or to replacement addresses that may be later designated in writing).\nThe City:\nCompany:\nThe City of Topeka\nBrenda Younger, City Clerk\n215 SE 7th Street, Room 166\nTopeka, Kansas 66603\nPhone: 785-368-3940\nFax: 785-368-3943\nEmail: cclerk@topeka.org\nKansas Gas Service, a Div. of ONE Gas, Inc.\nAttn: Legal Department\n7421 W. 129th Street\nOverland Park, KS 66213-2713\nPhone: (913) 319-8619\nFax: N/A\nEmail: kgsfranchises@onegas.com\nEmergency Contact Information: Emergency Designee: Consolidated Emergency Communications Center (CECC)\nEmergency Contact No.: 911\nEmergency Email: N/A\nSecondary Contact Email: bcopley@topeka.org\nNatural Gas Emergency No: 888-492-4950\nContact Email: KGSDispatchOverlandPark@onegas.com\n(or to replacement addresses that may be later designated in writing).\n(Ord. 20503 § 15, 7-30-24.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"365733c4-8945-550e-984f-1285a2efd13c"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"AxB Art. XIII § 1 § 15","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/AxB_ArtXIII_1_15","content_hash":"467e30bf2f71f962959069bb845d59baa2c67ee2e48f4f57729f76f43f286791","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xiii-1-15:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xiii-1-15:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/AxB_ArtXIII_1_15","text":"The company shall at all times maintain with the City a local point of contact who shall be available at all times to act on behalf of company in the event of an emergency. Company shall provide the City with said local contact’s name, address, telephone number, fax number, and e-mail address. Emergency notice by either party to the other may be made by telephone to the City’s designee as listed below. All other notices between the parties shall be in writing and shall be made by personal delivery, depositing such notice in the U.S. mail, certified mail (return receipt requested), or via the email addresses provided below. Any notice served by U.S. mail or certified mail (return receipt requested) shall be deemed delivered upon actual receipt unless otherwise provided. Other than emergencies, notices to the parties shall be to the following:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"0ba1c780-68e3-5976-a66d-323821039989"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"table"},"citation":"AxB Art. XIII § 1 § 15","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/AxB_ArtXIII_1_15","content_hash":"77fbd0011527414234329c4849a1b5b446d9edd54e6656e58ab26901686f7da8","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xiii-1-15:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xiii-1-15:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/AxB_ArtXIII_1_15","text":"The City: | Company:\nThe City of Topeka Brenda Younger, City Clerk 215 SE 7th Street, Room 166 Topeka, Kansas 66603 Phone: 785-368-3940 Fax: 785-368-3943 Email: cclerk@topeka.org | Kansas Gas Service, a Div. of ONE Gas, Inc. Attn: Legal Department 7421 W. 129th Street Overland Park, KS 66213-2713 Phone: (913) 319-8619 Fax: N/A Email: kgsfranchises@onegas.com\nEmergency Contact Information: Emergency Designee: Consolidated Emergency Communications Center (CECC) Emergency Contact No.: 911 Emergency Email: N/A Secondary Contact Email: bcopley@topeka.org | Natural Gas Emergency No: 888-492-4950 Contact Email: KGSDispatchOverlandPark@onegas.com\n(or to replacement addresses that may be later designated in writing).","type":"table","workbench_component_id":"ba4dd894-13bb-5bfc-8b0c-66f59b3e71a3"},{"attributes":{"block_ki